  {:name :_cm-js-handler
   :lambda-params []
   :description "Ring handler for `GET /assets/codemirror.min.js` — the vendored CodeMirror bundle with the standard 1-year `immutable` cache headers (hash-bust via `?v=` on the script tag)."
